  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">매번 재과만에서 좋은 수업아이디어를 많이 얻어가서, 이번에는 제가 주제선택활동에서 </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">진행해본 수업 경험을 공유해보고자 합니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;수업의 기획 </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&gt;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span></strong><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">아이디어&nbsp;기반 : 사진작가 </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">Tatiana Mikhina의 작품</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">기획 의도</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"> : 생물의 아름다움을 느끼게 해주자!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Tatiana Mikhina의 작품 &gt;</span></strong><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990590505D9ACA4333\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"270\" height=\"339\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 339px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"48.png\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"547\"  id=\"A_990590505D9ACA4333AED3\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E3AD505D9ACA440F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"241\" height=\"339\" style=\"width: 241px; height: 339px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"268.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_99E3AD505D9ACA440FAA60\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D90D505D9ACA4402\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"301\" height=\"342\" style=\"width: 301px; height: 342px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"358.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"500\"  id=\"A_99D90D505D9ACA4402395E\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">위의 작품처럼 원근감을 이용하여 사진을 촬영하는 것도 학생들이 충분히 할 수 있겠다 생각했습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">그런데&nbsp;꽃이 진 10월에 꽃을 찾기도 어려울 뿐더러, 잎을 이용해서는 그럴싸한 사진을 만들기 힘들겠다는 생각이 들었습니다. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">마침 위의 작품과 비슷한 그림(?)들을 인터넷에서 우연히 찾게 되었고, 이를 응용하기로 하였습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Tang-chiew-ling의 작품 &gt;</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995AFE465D9ACC7E1B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"194\" height=\"304\" style=\"width: 194px; height: 304px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"Tang-Chiew-Ling.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_995AFE465D9ACC7E1BC6F6\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9924D5465D9ACC7E05\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"219\" height=\"307\" style=\"width: 219px; height: 307px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"Tang-Chiew-Ling3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_9924D5465D9ACC7E050DD4\"/>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993593465D9ACC7E04\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"179\" height=\"305\" style=\"width: 179px; height: 305px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"Tang-Chiew-Ling5.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_993593465D9ACC7E041C3A\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;수업 과정과 학생</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;작품 &gt;</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994AA74A5D9ACDC00B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_994AA74A5D9ACDC00BC53F\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9970084A5D9ACDC034\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_9970084A5D9ACDC034608D\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996DA84A5D9ACDC134\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_996DA84A5D9ACDC134144B\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991D834A5D9ACDC137\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"4.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_991D834A5D9ACDC1379AAB\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993E534A5D9ACDC136\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"5.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_993E534A5D9ACDC136D1EE\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99ADE74A5D9ACDC107\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"6.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_99ADE74A5D9ACDC1075613\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E3544A5D9ACDC205\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"7.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_99E3544A5D9ACDC20541C0\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FFA24A5D9ACDC204\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"8.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_99FFA24A5D9ACDC2042E5A\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A0764B5D9ACDC20D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"9.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_99A0764B5D9ACDC20D55DF\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span></strong></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;수업 후 느낀 점&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&gt;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span></strong><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">좋았던 점 1. 학생들이 진정으로 즐거워하는 표정이였음</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 학생들의 뛰어난 그림 실력에 다시 한번 놀람</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 식물을 채집하는 과정에서 야외 수업을 진행하다보니, 학생들이 수업에 대한 높은 집중을 보임</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>아쉬운 점 1. 식물을 말린 후에 사용하면 더욱 좋을듯</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 생물을 활용한 소재(거미줄로 만든 방탄 조끼)에 대한 언급을 하면 좋을듯</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 4월에 진행하면 잎 뿐만 아니라 꽃도 사용할 수 있어서 더욱 다채로운 수업을 진행할 수 있을듯</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
